e":"本章节需规定药物过量的定义、临床表现识别、紧急处理措施、给药错误的分类与报告流程。允许来源未提供SGC-R23已知过量表现、药理学过量效应、解毒或支持治疗措施，亦未给出给药错误（如漏服、重复给药、误服安慰剂/活性药）的分类标准、报告时限及处理流程。按任务指令，药物过量与给药错误在缺少对应项目文件时必须标记source_gap。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_5971ad9ff8d17ef6","section_number":"6.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:44e86c987a5bc18e89727ff4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003142323_3e56fbd2","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"SGC-R23薄膜衣片口服，每日一次，连续给药12周；随机分配至低、中、高三个剂量组之一","quote_sha256":"58fa86ef40a100015d7eef9656d3596a956e16d30f3e25f932b1088a9e90c4ef","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_65_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"筛选（V1，-28~-1天）、基线随机（V2，D1）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3–V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，W12）、末次给药后28天安全性随访（V8）","quote_sha256":"eead1da9967006b9cb83c5c26633427329b2527be67609637926ccb313719876","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_65_visits"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_65_dosing","es_65_visits"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"确定依从性评价方法（药片计数、电子给药监测、受试者日记、血药浓度等）及具体实施访视时点，确认是否所有门诊访视均包含依从性检查。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_65_method","missing_source_classes":["依从性评价方法学文件","访视操作手册中依从性检查条目"],"target":"6.5 研究治疗依从性"},{"action":"确定依从性判定阈值（如药片计数百分比范围）及不依从的处理流程。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_65_threshold","missing_source_classes":["依从性判定标准与不依从处理规程"],"target":"6.5 研究治疗依从性"}],"heading":"研究治疗依从性","missing_source_classes":["依从性评价方法学文件","访视操作手册中依从性检查条目"],"proposal_text":"本研究试验干预为SGC-R23薄膜衣片或外观一致的安慰剂片，口服每日一次，连续给药12周，随机分配至低、中、高三个剂量组之一。访视安排包括第2周（V3）、第4周（V4）、第8周（V5）、第12周（V6）门诊访视，治疗结束访视（V7）安排在第12周，末次给药后28天进行安全性随访（V8）。依从性评价方法、实施时点及判定阈值尚未在现有项目文件中明确，需由医学团队根据口服每日一次给药方案及上述访视结构确定后写入正式方案。","rationale":"允许来源确认了给药方案（口服每日一次×12周）和访视时间框架（V3–V8），但未指定依从性评价方法（药片计数、电子监测、日记卡、血药浓度等）及是否在每个访视均实施。按任务指令，不得由已有访视日推断依从性评价在每个访视都实施，亦不得自行定义采集窗口。本章节仅写入已确认的给药与访视事实，具体评价方法列为待确认项。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_9d65e16f5b3e052d","section_number":"6.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:44e86c987a5bc18e89727ff4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"b069d997537a6ce42320b6acdf21b522dc0146cf81829e70c4421aea40042c1a","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_787e4e3b7172115a:full-draft:44e86c987a5bc18e89727ff4","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:44e86c987a5bc18e89727ff4","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:8cee17a814ab6b5d71b00ede84562669291ad122f7bab7977edc1d20f66ac9e6:44e86c987a5bc18e89727ff4","text_sha256":"b069d997537a6ce42320b6acdf21b522dc0146cf81829e70c4421aea40042c1a"},{"content_sha256":"fc902d6acd0db3c4ae2d8a06f9d95cd2a30bf22d794f9d1663b021fd716ff12e","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","text_sha256":"fc902d6acd0db3c4ae2d8a06f9d95cd2a30bf22d794f9d1663b021fd716ff12e"}]}